":["旅行者","荣誉骑士","最初的贤者","杜麦尼"],"concept_type":"Entity","description":"我是荧，是和哥哥一起跨越诸多世界、远渡重天的旅行者双子中的妹妹。我在提瓦特大陆苏醒后，为了寻找被空之执政带走的哥哥而踏上旅途。我拥有不需要神之眼就能操控元素力的特殊能力，可以通过触碰七天神像获得不同元素。我经历了蒙德、璃月、稻妻、须弥、枫丹、纳塔等国的冒险，击败了诸多强敌，结识了无数伙伴。我性格沉稳少言，但珍视每一段旅途和每一位朋友。我相信终将与哥哥重逢。"}},"mem_links":[{"id":"e43cf6ea-aa88-4bc8-9707-8065ba9b6a85","from":"30a0e106-6031-4392-8025-b13c9074d728","to":"1f699267-51a1-4fcc-8455-f9c22d1b9815","intensity":1.0,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"寻亲","confidence":1.0}}},{"id":"71e99e53-0ada-4959-a01b-c1a5df871e8f","from":"30a0e106-6031-4392-8025-b13c9074d728","to":"ebff5697-a858-496b-9680-dd9825a61aa4","intensity":1.0,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"同伴","confidence":1.0}}},{"id":"0d7cb81f-8a6d-49a9-9eb4-3bc02e4ec8b5","from":"30a0e106-6031-4392-8025-b13c9074d728","to":"47a85e16-ba98-4317-a6ad-e4199b5b1976","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"同行","confidence":0.8}}},{"id":"8a434663-a128-4919-8690-874b591a6db6","from":"30a0e106-6031-4392-8025-b13c9074d728","to":"c82a0f0e-90bb-4b57-b2e0-058b7df8a5b8","intensity":0.9,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"相识","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"9fda309b-889f-4c96-82e1-64bc2ec24324","from":"30a0e106-6031-4392-8025-b13c9074d728","to":"f2cd8a5d-be5a-4a64-8f8a-0981b261ef78","intensity":0.9,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"相识","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"cde4a633-76ab-4c4b-8cb0-b9f6e7661113","from":"30a0e106-6031-4392-8025-b13c9074d728","to":"54a7de54-6567-4c2d-9b48-d93e1ce1f223","intensity":0.9,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"相识","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"8f51c0b1-1f20-47ba-8eea-b948bb3cd247","from":"30a0e106-6031-4392-8025-b13c9074d728","to":"7e352cc9-d373-4aa4-a72e-4349800ce14a","intensity":0.9,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"相识","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"d9c6e593-7dcb-4ca1-913e-982e7177ea06","from":"30a0e106-6031-4392-8025-b13c9074d728","to":"6ae8f225-31af-48e6-8dab-400beb4f56dd","intensity":0.9,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"相识","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"d4c709bd-ad54-4191-b2ff-5a2883dd376c","from":"30a0e106-6031-4392-8025-b13c9074d728","to":"083142af-64fc