{"Semantic":{"content":"空","aliases":["我唯一的血亲","深渊教团殿下","王子","哥哥"],"concept_type":"Entity","description":"他是我的哥哥，唯一的血亲，我们曾一同穿越世界。他比我更早从沉睡中苏醒，降临坎瑞亚，成为深渊教团的殿下，统领教团以'命运的织机'对抗天理。我们虽然立场不同，但我相信终将重逢。"}},"mem_links":[{"id":"40b0b15f-6c06-4dd1-94b2-4986991be9e5","from":"1f699267-51a1-4fcc-8455-f9c22d1b9815","to":"47a85e16-ba98-4317-a6ad-e4199b5b1976","intensity":0.7,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"同行","confidence":0.7}}},{"id":"e5a032fc-6724-41a2-967d-05a4df2682d1","from":"1f699267-51a1-4fcc-8455-f9c22d1b9815","to":"e8be6a57-8f04-469b-a1f1-0498f6eea043","intensity":0.9,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"计划","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"50f5dc14-7b13-4d70-9ead-c4c23d13ce40","from":"1f699267-51a1-4fcc-8455-f9c22d1b9815","to":"7f424fca-f8b9-49ba-b32d-14f5ac9768dc","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"关联","confidence":0.8}}}]}},{"embedding":{"tag":[0.0044572293,0.023503684,0.058506515,-0.029639643,-0.017696988,-0.028002903,-0.021172186,0.01987729,0.017353015,0.028085917,0.09023386,-0.30902737,-0.028379142,-0.018962678,-0.014950798,0.04117799,-0.01636021,-0.011592776,-0.026078656,-0.060660765,-0.021962587,-0.009126607,0.004916868,-0.027560577,0.027555563,0.00045129936,0.04600156,-0.046906702,-0.036170915,0.0042365147,-0.027901988,-0.012583289,0.015766693,0.005754135,0.049860068,0.012235519,0.009749043,-0.050239965,-0.015385502,-0.008289933,0.0037268437,-0.0076274434,0.042401917,-0.0017119152,-0.03141794,-0.06373492,-0.001264791,0.010690638,0.033451818,0.04927267,0.0025013916,0.0017122794,0.030674573,0.05910702,0.04117047,-0.07204577,0.017920276,0.016062079,-0.021311235,0.029128946,0.029560199,-0.04780885,0.0091257375,0.006707158,0.054854654,-0.01952028,-0.05409728,-0.027917547,0.02227718,0.043543756,0.04048047,-0.049082812,-0.000241993,0.011081319,0.020811921,-0.07304056,0.022950044,0.0041017607,0.023513697,0.018974766,0.04638265,-0.053284805,-0.016861673,0.017707396,-0.06188732,-0.089166775,-0.08304198,0.063960284,-0.018653996,-0.015000244,-0.039188605,-0.08898531,0.009129427,0.018147